## Ignore Visual Studio user-specific files
*.user
*.suo
*.sln.docstates
.vs/

## Build results
bin/
obj/
Debug/
Release/
x64/

## Test results
TestResult*/
BuildLog.*
*.log
*.svclog

## Rider/JetBrains files
.idea/
*.DotSettings.user

## NuGet packages
packages/
!packages/repositories.config

## Publish output
publish/
*.Publish.xml
*.pubxml
*.azurePubxml

## Client-side libraries (optional if using LibMan, Bower, etc.)
wwwroot/lib/

## SQL Server database files
App_Data/*.mdf
App_Data/*.ldf
*.dbmdl

## Visual Studio cache
ipch/
*.aps
*.cache
*.ncb
*.sdf
*.opensdf
*.cachefile

## ReSharper files
_ReSharper*/
*.[Rr]e[Ss]harper

## Click-Once deployment
publish/

## Backup, upgrade, and conversion logs
_UpgradeReport_Files/
Backup*/
UpgradeLog*.XML
UpgradeLog*.htm

